Package: cheesecloth
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: wireguard-tools
Description: WireGuard mesh network with identity-based membership
 cheesecloth builds a private mesh network between a small number of
 machines using WireGuard. Every node connects directly to every other
 node over an encrypted tunnel, gets a fixed private address and a
 hostname entry, and reconnects after a restart without intervention.
 .
 There is no central server and no shared password. Nodes are admitted
 with a short-lived invitation token and removed with a single command.
 Membership is a set of signed records rooted at the first node.
